        <p source="#source-6234-6352"><seg source="#source-6234-6246">二とせや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6246-6267"><rb>緞子</rb><rt>どんす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6267-6300">張りたる高椅子のうへに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6300-6312"><rb>坐</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6312-6321">るまで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-6321-6333"><rb>児</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-6333-6352">は丈のびぬ</seg></p>
